    "USB position: the 'Type-C USB' label points to an inset photo; in the main board view (the one the labels are read from) the USB connector is identified only from an unlabeled metal shell partially visible at the bottom edge. If that is not accepted as a visible USB connector, the top/left rule applies and both header orders and both GWIIC orders reverse."
  ],
  "notes": "Header labels from the callout boxes; board silkscreen (IO16, RST, TXD, I00 read as IO0, 3.3V, 5V ...) placed first in functions when it differs. GWIIC labels from the board silkscreen next to the two 4-pin connectors. Skipped: 1.25mm battery JST (only - and + marks), ON/OFF switch, Reset/Boot buttons, antenna connectors. LoRa module, OLED and TF card tables list MCU GPIO assignments with no physical pin positions and are not transcribed."
